* TPS16630 behavioral with the overload current-limit loop (used by s4_efuse.py for the overload case and the healthy slots).
* Same SCP state machine as TPS16630B in behav.lib, plus: when I > I(OL) the gate slews down (full range in tcl = 20 us),
* regulating the current at I(OL); below I(OL) it slews back to fully on. The slew limit keeps a hard short reaching the 45 A
* fast trip first (<= 7.5 % conduction loss in the 1.5 us response), as the real part does.
.subckt TPS16630OL IN OUT PARAMS: ron=19m iscp=45 tresp=1.0 iol=6.30 tcl=20u
Vs IN n1 0
Bdet detr 0 V = time < 1n ? 0 : max(V(det), 0.5*(1+tanh((i(Vs)-{iscp})/0.5)))
Rdet detr det 1k
Cdet det 0 10p
Btt 0 tt I = time < 1n ? -V(tt)*1m : 1m*0.5*(1+tanh((V(det)-0.5)/0.02))
Ctt tt 0 1n
Rtt tt 0 1G
Bf ff 0 V = V(tt) < {tresp} ? 1 : (V(tt) < {tresp}+0.2 ? 1-(V(tt)-{tresp})/0.2 : 0)
Bg 0 gc I = time < 1n ? (1-V(gc))*1m : (1n/{tcl})*(-tanh((i(Vs)-{iol})/0.3)) - 1m*min(V(gc),0) - 1m*max(V(gc)-1,0)
Cg gc 0 1n
Rg gc 0 1G
Bsw n1 OUT I = V(tt) < ({tresp}+5.2) ? V(ff)*max(min(V(gc),1),0)*V(n1,OUT)/{ron} : min(max(V(n1,OUT),0)/{ron}, {iol})
Cp n1 OUT 100p
.ends
